SUMMARY:Reptile Pop Quiz
DESCRIPTION:Test your reptile identification skills with this virtual ecoEXPLORE program and see how many local reptiles you can identify! \nThis program is aimed at kids in grades K-8 interested in being a part of the ecoEXPLORE collaborative science project\, but all are welcome. \nRegister
URL:https://www.naturalsciences.org/calendar/event/reptile-pop-quiz/
LOCATION:Virtual\, NC\, United States
CATEGORIES:Children,Citizen Science,ecoEXPLORE,K-12 Students,Teens,Virtual
