SUMMARY:Science TODAY: Live Gila Monster Feeding
DESCRIPTION:June 3 is National Egg Day\, and we’re celebrating by showcasing our special egg predator\, Gila Monsters! NCMNS Animal Care Staff will feed a gila monster live on stage in the SECU Daily Planet Theater. \nGo inside the globe of the SECU Daily Planet Theater for live presentations and interactive shows led by scientists and educators. Meet researchers\, witness live demonstrations\, and engage in Q&A sessions with experts. With ever-changing topics and guests\, there’s always something new and exciting to learn.
URL:https://www.naturalsciences.org/calendar/event/science-today-summer-2025/
LOCATION:Nature Research Center\, 121 West Jones Street\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27601\, United States
CATEGORIES:Adults,All Ages,Children,Discussions,Lectures,SECU Daily Planet Theater,Teens,Walk-up Programs
