SUMMARY:Return of the Wild: Lewis & Clark Resurvey Livestream
DESCRIPTION:Starting May 1\, Museum mammalogist Dr. Roland Kays and colleagues will retrace the historic route of Lewis and Clark\, comparing historic wildlife observations to what camera traps find today. Along the way\, Kays and company will meet local experts to learn how animal populations have changed over the 250 years of our country’s history. Follow along on the Return of the Wild site and YouTube channel . \nJoin the expedition in the SECU Daily Planet Theater or watch the livestream on YouTube to receive the latest updates on the trek.\n\n1:00pm on Sunday May 3\n1:00pm on Sunday May 10\n1:00pm on Saturday May 16\n11:00am on Thursday May 28\n11:00am on Thursday June 4
URL:https://www.naturalsciences.org/calendar/event/return-of-the-wild-lewis-clark-resurvey-livestream/2026-06-04/
LOCATION:Nature Research Center\, 121 West Jones Street\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27601\, United States
CATEGORIES:SECU Daily Planet Theater
ORGANIZER;CN="Chris%20Smith":MAILTO:christopher.smith@naturalsciences.org
GEO:35.7822405;-78.6409677
