SUMMARY:North Carolina's Amazing Reptiles and Amphibians
DESCRIPTION:North Carolina is home to some spectacular herps! Join ecoEXPLORE Central NC to explore the amazing herps right here in our own state in this virtual program. \nThis program is for kids ages 5-13 in the ecoEXPLORE program\, but all are welcome! You will learn about ecoEXPLORE during the program. \nRegister
