SUMMARY:Tree Walk With a Naturalist
DESCRIPTION:Explore the Jesse P. Perry III Arboretum at Prairie Ridge and get to know our local trees in this program for ages 12+! On this 1-to-2-mile hike\, we’ll dive into the basics of tree identification and share interesting facts about ten different species each session. You’ll also discover how to become a contributor to Nature’s Notebook\, a collaborative science project where you can help researchers by tracking the life cycles of plants and animals throughout the seasons. \nRegister
URL:https://www.naturalsciences.org/calendar/event/tree-walk-with-a-naturalist/
LOCATION:Prairie Ridge\, 1671 Gold Star Drive\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27607\, United States
CATEGORIES:Adults,Children,Citizen Science,Educators,K-12 Students,Outdoor Experiences,Teens
